            "Convert into a new page": [
                "Yipada si oju-iwe tuntun"
            ],
            "Turn a Figma frame into an editable page: auto layout becomes rows, columns and grids, text keeps its fonts and sizes, and images are copied into your media library. The site talks to Figma with your own Figma account; nothing goes through us.": [
                "Yi freemu Figma kan pada si oju-iwe ti a le satunk\u1ecd: auto layout yoo di aw\u1ecdn ila, aw\u1ecdn \u1ecdw\u1ecd\u0300n ati aw\u1ecdn aw\u1ecd\u0300n, \u1ecdr\u1ecd yoo pa aw\u1ecdn fonti ati aw\u1ecdn iw\u1ecdn r\u1eb9 m\u1ecd\u0301, a o si daak\u1ecd aw\u1ecdn aworan sinu ile-ikawe media r\u1eb9. Aaye naa n ba Figma s\u1ecdr\u1ecd p\u1eb9lu ak\u1ecd\u1ecdl\u1eb9 Figma tir\u1eb9; ko si ohun ti n gba \u1ecdd\u1ecd wa k\u1ecdja."
            ],
            "Figma personal access token": [
                "\u00c0m\u00ec \u00e0w\u1ecdl\u00e9 ti ara \u1eb9ni Figma"
